  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackle: Promote the emergence of young activism against discrimination and structural racism in Europe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The action aims to &#xbf;Contribute to achieve a more inclusive society with a developed sense of co-responsibility for local and global sustainable development and global challenges, notably inequalities&#xbf;. To this end, the consortium will work to achieve the two specific objectives: 1) Contributing to the emergence of a new generation of &quot;equality advocates&quot; among European students and groups directly concerned by racism and discriminations, including from a gender perspective; and 2) Fostering a new positive narrative on migration by strengthening the advocacy and campaigning capacity of youth and grassroots civil society organizations.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
